  <title>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Access rights updated</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>حقوق دسترسی به‌روزرسانی شد</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Diritti di accesso aggiornati</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Prawa dostępu zostały zaktualizowane</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Права доступа обновлены</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Erişim yetkileri güncellendi</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đã cập nhật quyền truy cập</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>PictureAndLabel</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>Picture</name>
      <id>3</id>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>PictureExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>5</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>PictureContextMenu</name>
        <id>4</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:PictureDecorationExtInfo">
        <picture xsi:type="core:PictureRef">
          <picture>StdPicture.DialogInformation</picture>
        </picture>
        <fileDragMode>AsFileRef</fileDragMode>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>Label</name>
      <id>6</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Administrator changed access rights.
Restart the application so that they come into force.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>مدیر سیستم حقوق دسترسی را تغییر داده است.
برنامه را مجدداً راه‌اندازی کنید تا اعمال شوند.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Администратор изменил права доступа.
Перезапустите приложение, чтобы они вступили в силу.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Yönetici erişim yetkilerini değiştirdi.
Değişikliklerin devreye girmesi için programı yeniden başlatın.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Người quản trị đã thay đổi quyền truy cập.
Hãy khởi động lại ứng dụng để chúng có hiệu lực.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Administrator changed access rights.
Restart the application so that they come into force.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Administrator changed access rights.
Restart the application so that they come into force.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>LabelExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>8</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>LabelContextMenu</name>
        <id>7</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
